      "type": "spotlight",
      "item": "tribalpower:ember_horn",
      "text": [
        "The Drumhearts' craft: a horn that burns furnace fuel into Pulse. Coal, charcoal, lava, blaze rods: whatever a furnace burns, the horn turns into steady power.",
        "It holds **1,000 Pulse**."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Feeding it",
      "text": [
        "Right-click it with fuel, or let a hopper or relay feed it. The fuel's burn time divided by twenty is its Pulse: coal is **80**, a coal block **800**, a lava bucket **1,000**, a blaze rod **120**.",
        "It lets that Pulse out at up to **20 a second**. More fuel does not raise the cap; it only lasts longer.",
        "It lights the next piece only when it has room, so a full horn wastes nothing. The empty bucket from lava comes back out; nothing else can be pulled from a lit fire."
      ]
    },
