    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Scaling up",
      "text": [
        "Unranked, the horn makes at most **20 a second**. Ranking adds **15% Pulse a second** per rank. Beyond that, build more horns.",
        "No loop you can automate turns fuel into more fuel than it burns. Even coal called up by the Listening Pit costs more Pulse to fetch and shatter than it gives back.",
        "An empty-handed click tells you what it makes and holds. Crouch and right-click it with this book to see the fuel and the burn still owed.",
        "Horns are the [Drumhearts'](tribe_spark) craft: the recipe needs a Cinder Knot and a Fire Seal, and the Drumhearts trade a horn to anyone they call Friend."
      ]
